   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-9886 Biodiversity Finance Plan-Lesotho</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Umbrella Programme aims to support the development of biodiversity finance plans globally, addressing a $700 billion financing gap. It will assess policy and institutional contexts, review expenditures, and identify financial needs. The programme intends to overcome barriers such as limited awareness, coordination, and capacity among national stakeholders, and insufficient documentation of relevant expenditure data.</narrative>
  </description>
